---
import LegalPage from "../components/LegalPage.astro";
---

<LegalPage title="Terms of Service — Ironlox" canonicalURL="https://ironlox.com/terms">
  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
    <p class="text-surface-200 leading-relaxed text-sm">
      By creating an Ironlox account or using any Ironlox service, you agree to be bound by
      these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, do not create an account or use the service.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">2. Service Description</h2>
    <p class="text-surface-200 leading-relaxed text-sm">
      Ironlox is a zero-knowledge password management service. All vault data (passwords, credit
      cards, notes, identities, file attachments) is encrypted on your device using AES-256-GCM
      before transmission to our servers. We cannot decrypt or access your plaintext data under
      any circumstances. The service is provided "as is" with no guarantee of uninterrupted availability.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">3. User Responsibilities</h2>
    <ul class="text-surface-200 mt-3 space-y-2.5 text-sm list-disc list-inside leading-relaxed">
      <li>You are solely responsible for safeguarding your master password. We cannot recover or reset it.</li>
      <li>Maintain accurate and up-to-date account information.</li>
      <li>Do not use the service for illegal activities or to store illicit content.</li>
      <li>Export your vault data periodically as a backup. We are not responsible for data loss.</li>
      <li>You must be at least 13 years old to use the service.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">4. Free and Premium Tiers</h2>
    <p class="text-surface-200 leading-relaxed text-sm">
      The free tier provides core password management features (unlimited passwords, unlimited
      devices, autofill, password generator, import). Premium features (TOTP 2FA authenticator,
      tags, custom fields, vault export, file attachments up to 2 GB, vault health reports,
      priority support) require a paid subscription.
      On downgrade from Premium to Free, access to Premium-only features is immediately revoked.
      Stored file attachments exceeding the free tier limit may be deleted after a 30-day grace period.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">5. Billing and Payment</h2>
    <p class="text-surface-200 leading-relaxed text-sm">
      Premium subscriptions are billed in advance on a monthly or annual basis through Stripe.
      You may cancel at any time. Cancellation takes effect at the end of the current billing
      period. Refunds are not provided for partial billing periods, except where required by law.
      We reserve the right to change pricing with 30 days' notice.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p class="text-surface-200 leading-relaxed text-sm">
      Ironlox is provided "as is" without warranty of any kind, express or implied. We are not
      liable for any damages arising from use or inability to use the service, including but not
      limited to data loss, security breaches resulting from user negligence, or third-party
      actions. Our total liability shall not exceed the amount you paid us in the 12 months
      preceding the claim. Some jurisdictions do not allow these limitations &mdash; they may
      not apply to you.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">7. Account Termination</h2>
    <p class="text-surface-200 leading-relaxed text-sm">
      You may terminate your account at any time through the dashboard. We may suspend or
      terminate accounts for violation of these terms, illegal activity, or non-payment.
      On termination, data is permanently deleted after the 7-day grace period described
      in our Privacy Policy.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">8. Changes to Terms</h2>
    <p class="text-surface-200 leading-relaxed text-sm">
      We may update these terms from time to time. Material changes will be communicated via
      email at least 30 days before taking effect. Continued use after changes take effect
      constitutes acceptance. If you disagree with the changes, you must terminate your account
      before they take effect.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">9. Contact</h2>
    <p class="text-surface-200 leading-relaxed text-sm">
      For legal inquiries, contact
      <a href="mailto:legal@ironlox.com" class="text-brand-400 hover:underline">legal@ironlox.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalPage>
